title: "energy-dashboard-for-kokkos"
abstract: >-
  Per-region energy attribution for Kokkos applications: reads the power trace
  recorded by a Kokkos Tools connector and attributes the measured energy to
  regions and kernels, with a terminal table, a Perfetto trace and an HTML report.
